  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in the bottom of a clay tagine or a large cast-iron pot over medium heat.",
    "add the chopped onion and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the cumin and coriander, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the amizake and simmer for 5 minutes, or until slightly thickened.",
    "add the ferment-kimchi and cook for 2-3 minutes, or until the flavors have melded together.",
    "add the cod fillets, salt to taste, and simmer for 8-10 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh cilantro if desired.",
    "enjoy as a late-night snack or light meal."
